> diff x^3 + 2*x
d/dx x^3 + 2x = 3x^2 + 2
  holds for every real x
  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 2e-15)
> diff sin(x)*exp(x)
d/dx sin(x)*exp(x) = exp(x)*cos(x) + sin(x)*exp(x)
  holds for every real x
  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 8e-15)
> diff (x^2+1)^5
d/dx (x^2 + 1)^5 = 10x*(x^2 + 1)^4
  holds for every real x
  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 3e-15)
> diff sqrt(x^2 + 3)
d/dx sqrt(x^2 + 3) = x/sqrt(x^2 + 3)
  holds for x^2 + 3 >= 0
  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 1e-15)
> diff sin(2x) + cos(3x)^2
d/dx sin(2x) + cos(3x)^2 = 2cos(2x) - 6cos(3x)*sin(3x)
  holds for every real x
  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 6e-12)
